Description: Tools for calculating, visualizing, and exporting spatial
    phylogenetic diversity patterns. The package supports alpha and beta
    phylogenetic diversity indices, spatial null models, regionalization
    analyses, interactive maps, raster outputs, and a bundled Shiny app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
